        <p>
          Check it before the model has to guess.
        </p>

        <p>
          Use Check Input to find missing, unclear, ambiguous, conflicting,
          unstated, undefined, incomplete, or implied criteria in the input.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a href="/workbench/check-input/">Open Check Input</a>
        </p>

        <p>
          Already know the Issue, Pattern, Lens, category, or code you need?
